      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "anchor": "overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Horror Toy Factory equipment is enchanted by Black Beard Joe in Lutie (xmas)."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The number of enchants and the option types depend on the equipment type; for accessories, the failure and destruction risk grows with each enchant step."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Enchant Targets",
      "anchor": "target"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Category",
        "Eligible Equipment"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Accessory",
          "[ITEM:2976|Red Lantern], [ITEM:2977|Wounded Heart], [ITEM:2978|Gentle Heart], [ITEM:2980|Evil Thread Glove]"
        ],
        [
          "Weapon",
          "[ITEM:13442|Old Parasol]"
        ],
        [
          "Headgear",
          "[ITEM:18848|Lush Rose], [ITEM:18849|Celine's Ribbon]"
        ],
        [
          "Shoes",
          "[ITEM:2486|Shadow Walk]"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Noble Cross",
      "text": "Black Beard Joe does not enchant the [ITEM:16029|Noble Cross]. That weapon is enchanted by Mayomayo in the enchant zone."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
