    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Accessory Enchant",
      "anchor": "accessory"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Accessories can be enchanted up to 3 times; each time you choose one of two option categories."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Category",
        "Available Options"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "STR / AGI / DEX category",
          "Random among STR, AGI and DEX"
        ],
        [
          "INT / VIT / DEX category",
          "Random among INT, VIT and DEX"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Step",
        "Slot",
        "Success Rate",
        "Possible Value",
        "On Failure"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "1st",
          "Slot 4",
          "About 95%",
          "1~2",
          "Equipment destroyed"
        ],
        [
          "2nd",
          "Slot 3",
          "About 70%",
          "1~3",
          "Equipment destroyed"
        ],
        [
          "3rd",
          "Slot 2",
          "Under 50%",
          "1~4",
          "Equipment destroyed"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Destruction Risk",
      "text": "A failed accessory enchant destroys the equipment. The risk grows from the 2nd enchant on, so proceed carefully."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Weapon Enchant",
      "anchor": "weapon"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The weapon enchant can be done only once on the [ITEM:13442|Old Parasol]; it never fails and adds an option to slot 4."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Slot",
        "Success Rate",
        "Available Options"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Slot 4",
          "100%",
          "Fighting Spirit Lv 5~10, Sharp Lv 3~5, MATK 1~3%, After Attack Delay reduction, ASPD +1, Spell Lv 6~9"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Headgear / Shoes Enchant",
      "anchor": "armor"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Headgear and shoes can be enchanted up to 2 times; it never fails and adds options to slot 4 and slot 3."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Step",
        "Slot",
        "Success Rate",
        "Available Options"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "1st",
          "Slot 4",
          "100%",
          "Fighting Spirit Lv 2~5, Sharp Lv 1~3, MATK 1~2%, After Attack Delay reduction, Spell Lv 3~6"
        ],
        [
          "2nd",
          "Slot 3",
          "100%",
          "Random STR, AGI, VIT, INT, DEX or LUK 1~3"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Notes",
      "anchor": "notice"
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "No Reset",
      "text": "Once applied, a Horror Toy Factory enchant cannot be reset by normal means."
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Equip the Item First",
      "text": "Black Beard Joe enchants the equipment you are wearing. Choose the menu for that equipment type."
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Check Your Materials",
      "text": "15 [ITEM:7642|Bloody Coin] are used right before each enchant attempt."
    },
